# Sarros PR review

Prioritise findings by risk:

- Blocker: data loss, security exposure, broken production path, failing build, incorrect migration.
- High: user-visible regression, incorrect business logic, unhandled integration failure.
- Medium: edge case, maintainability problem, missing meaningful test.
- Low: cleanup, naming, docs, minor consistency.

Check auth, API boundaries, data writes, migrations, external integrations, background jobs, money/quotes/invoices, customer data, and deletion paths first.
